- Analyze technical SEO
- Detect issues
- Generate audit reports
- Recommend fixes


### Keyword Intelligence Agent

Responsibilities:

- Discover keywords
- Analyze search intent
- Track opportunities
- Build keyword clusters


### Content Optimization Agent

Responsibilities:

- Analyze content quality
- Suggest improvements
- Optimize SEO elements
- Generate content briefs


### Competitor Intelligence Agent

Responsibilities:

- Monitor competitors
- Analyze ranking changes
- Discover gaps
- Identify opportunities


### SEO Reporting Agent

Responsibilities:

- Collect SEO data
- Generate reports
- Track KPIs
- Provide insights


